<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Bashkortostan</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Republic of Bashkortostan, Bashkiria</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Bashkortostan is a republic of the Russian Federation in the southern Urals and the plains to their west, with its capital at Ufa. It is the homeland of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bashkirs">Bashkirs</a>, though Russians and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tatars">Tatars</a> also form large parts of its population. Rich in oil and farmland, it succeeded the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bashkir-autonomous-soviet-socialist-republic">Bashkir Autonomous Soviet Socialist Republic</a> in the early 1990s.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/bashkortostan.jpg" alt="Bashkortostan" width="320" height="213" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: multiple Автор: Conscious · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Bashkortostan.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
